flowchart LR
  user[Telegram User\nprivate chat\n/help /new /session] --> gateway[Telegram Gateway\npolling + allowlist\nper-chat queue]
  gateway --> binding[Conversation Binding\nchat + user -> sessionId\nJSON persisted]
  binding --> runner[Agent Runner\nforward prompt into bound session]
  runner --> agent[Agent Core\ngeneric model/tool loop\nfail-fast missing session]
  agent --> reply[Telegram Reply\nchunked Telegram-safe output]

  scheduler[Cron Scheduler\nreads scheduled jobs\nmatch cron\nrun once per minute\nstore lastRunAt] --> tasks[scheduled-tasks.json\nJSON task store]
  scheduler --> cronjob[Cron Job Execution]
  cronjob --> reply

  removed[Removed\napproval store/service\ntool-policy gating\n/approve /deny /approvals\n/remind\ndue-task claim/release]:::removed

  kept[Kept\nabortable Telegram polling\npersistent session bindings\nexplicit missing session throws]:::kept

  removed -. removed from runtime .-> gateway
  kept -. still active .-> gateway
  kept -. still active .-> agent

  classDef removed fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef kept fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#6d28d9,color:#4c1d95,stroke-width:2px;
